{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1285,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5da1eae27b4d8aab5fde238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天晚上我看了关于训练的书\r\n进行了想象训练！\r\n……虽然感觉还是很模糊就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "122b4c2b8a895446e2294ae0550472de76f886e1619a272c54ff765f43deb41b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8cf1a21bab4a951a3a4627f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信着能够全力支持我的，训练员你！\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d288c126476ad776ea26d501795ca694727673999baf7828023ed8cc9fa434",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2cc27e334bd0d993da6e2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员是训练员真的真的太好了！\r\n……嗯？感觉稍微有点拗口呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84aec64a4428e1296b25288d1585bb0f891f73b702cec435aac36260c45b5c8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4c8d8431817a35dfdee6064",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要成为我想成为的“城市女孩”\r\n如果是训练员的话，\r\n绝对绝——对，可以将其实现的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b0cab7597049411fd25fa6398f4e50e8caa3d7b565041458321e2db15e53e8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c18f6ca27958342440248ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里的海不怎么能见到黑尾鸥呢～\r\n听不到它们热闹的“miamia”声\r\n的话，就感觉缺了点什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67b4d1f0d1e2499e85418f05484cc601be9cd8ed9eabbc283b5ca364ebf9d5d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbad29f7164076b9517d218f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングをがんばると\r\nおやつが美味しくなりますよねぇ。\r\n今日は何を…っとと、集中集中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e74534a32d19b7a875c9c5aa886e24b5bbb2c03b1d2785f8da1328391e1fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc75cf38fb3571cb0ed77ac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お抹茶を点てるように\r\nしゃかしゃか走りますよっ！\r\nレースは甘くねぇですからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6507e4b4a2297099c8dc72067fcece21e4cbaa42066d31fff69e2d9c22a10ec1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae31892302148554463d1c2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日はどんなトレーニングです？\r\nあんこ練りで鍛えた筋肉、\r\nお見せしますよーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f862b27682b17693cc85c9beb02a515cd25e875651e35e79ba8ac796005d2ca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f3206444c707c9055201a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "たすきがけ、ほどけねえように\r\nしっかり結んできました！\r\n何でも来いですっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae3765fdd7b5669de29e69bcd0c7796117efe6992732cfef6504ae1d8339e85a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861b544a0ff53d70ded6929e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつもどおりに落ち着いて\r\nむつむつやるのが大事ですよね。\r\n特別じゃなぐてもいいンです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "781b106321540d0c0ca88c03bbcb39f2b69cb5067551d79bbce139fe42e60d12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef5c852cc8b7ec9832f27dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つ、疲れたらお茶っこと和菓子で\r\nひと息入れましょうね。そのぅ…\r\nチョコの和菓子作ってきたので…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e1098765fe3a1677025ff96fd2c745ddac463967203f137de67a8663862aa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce1569d7eaff58ab124998a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんが見守っててくれる\r\nから、安心してがんばれます。\r\nこれまでも、これからも…です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1773249d9bbeb6c1d5a33ae116383c8b56818f4e5c0b6e88e75f672482225bc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:081684526cb22667e179da60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于成为真正的“城市女孩”了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f034aa593aa506061e4e6979513a6004653cf9cf06ae6d98bf2f106ad6e0b0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3fd7a22047b3e0fcc7fc91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "托您的福，取得了很好的结果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dc717aa7266163546a886a10ac1765df21aa9bbdcec560153f6992fc39d6499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307a9a61df9d67ef9a2a1b14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あなたの穏やかな笑顔に、励まされました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a51d963e23fc07f0e8492b57ee72b204d69af85394d2ce103b4459139f6ba73f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4cc62d2f525035d2ad49b9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真心とご指導、ありがとがんす！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13efcaa73407687672d8627f9317b16d88648eae10416d509921624e9861dfe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b8daed20c9bf6da6a680e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得越来越强了呗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9ba53c83dc858f9204215a7ac2c9e62746a0a39e493fd75bc18a0fb36740973",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a99efd4d016e71f2eabc3ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是崭新的“我”～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f79bd3338111a120cc893ce85ac21cedca028b7ea4c92132a92e6d1ebe283ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e5d75681367e8e3f6342f5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是！我是雪之美人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8dc4565fd47e6c989c2e554d203619f0b992ba205562785eb7f0e119121f459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:757805557bc6e5ad25999bba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝对绝对会成为，\r\n憧憬的“城市女孩”的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f433266cfd5da32d14533d913c9b338eb4e99ba5ed8a2ba04b91282a2694bc8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f5a27da848c4b6b14cde9d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "需要支援的话，就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4776378152ac5193718b058295ca0ac11a9c2ba5ca236f06f216ef25fdf2e11e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59c7599fc0b370638524b9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪国的毅力，就让你们见识下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "644d669883e2be5f56bdb4519becc70a87b18eb14d167d3e663f529bdb7a14bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2d95dad33ba4297d6adc172",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もーっと、んめぐしますよ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f974c18387cf8fa0fa0228d7f25c4a0e1fd78983e89be7606bd6f3f7dd84bb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:239ab71c5bbcc5c0982593e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今までの味、超えるなはんっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88efd36e5fcb6dd40b6b61618fbf77b66141d141ee4587e31f62ac38b79fde49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f973d1f0d4fd3ec2a0dc4f0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おでんせ！\r\nほっとする和菓子、いかがです？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb42f9c466cf016e474ce77f2048467838097d21692a5ac194445ea5d3aa27b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:750b336a2bedbcbb55b2335c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキノビジン！\r\n一応、看板娘です～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d171eb497287c6c7516393072ac24bc8f5a34c496198453174596c4117d38eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c01da6e6ae77d67bf2a5283",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发ー…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d15c8f496c4e0a1ae21e320dcabf7f63e1b6b2847911f0158188baf24d40121b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97a8cb347c663981fb012ef1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天都，虽然只有一点点，\n但逐渐接近想成为的自己…了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ec64afa6e62694bf5168d059447d2060bd6cf1b6ed020efde73aa3ec3c97acd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5936105fbea418abcdeae4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "22ec8548daac11d32380b504a3538d645f1fe46c0323029f6d3267d1f56eb8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644c8be3d8e80593e692763a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d8d81aedc68445fb8334730b6c72f38e8457b7886a4254fc48fbe2960e9f15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17adcf6f35040d177cdea0ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥…这个，那个…\n米浴，每天都会努力的。\n…也会慢慢地改变，相信我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c96371f67301ad4ac6ea1a3707b27cdefa54bae2b375f43b05f798d42fc234a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f32313fd85f94fdb972d7d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在呢。米浴对于自己…\n已经不会全部都讨厌了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9de52c0f702375192f7380908dce1308d33ac40fba35af17a4ea9caa240f7c9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3918a194fbf763bd0a65c047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\n…那个，哥哥…米浴今年也\n请多多指教…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94ae2cffe64959ee0a3db79bb2ff24f75192e86df1d50f36b247a4bff3400e94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:610d932c23bcd49c7820611b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其…其实呢，我做了，巧克力…\n虽然是米浴做的，也没关系吧…？\n如果能收下的话我会很高兴的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e0222ee615871055d817c90e9e447a85e77dcdc3b195eb30358a3f0351d666a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3311a10ae7361541d85588d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥。因为是情人节…\n和米浴一起做巧克力吧！\n食谱已经写好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d82b6bb3d6f190e27356e3bb4518067ce16eec996d619124f4d43f99fa5fa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507855c11f65a4e309cee7a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星星能实现大家的愿望，\n让大家幸福，真了不起呢。\n米浴也…嗯，要加油了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "490a292a0d586bab696cb3ca9979aea5b466bc8d688ff14e40ceca6e5b876d0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:837a999d76c7f509480c7d8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有点心也不会对你\n恶作剧哦…米浴也可以说一下，吗？\n不…不给糖·就·捣蛋…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff4af0365e36ed9cbef987f089889260b8eb8e58dd586d285901d8dc402df5b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55508a35ab99771ef2485474",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人的绘本\n有很多哦。每一个都\n洋溢着幸福，所以我很喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c502c84bad79c62dba808b2f6f73d08e446707968f38c95bd8e66d3eb5bb66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:079405fd2819e4d2de5ef6c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是烤的像圣诞老人\n衣服一样红的苹果蛋糕。\n哥哥…一起吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f99650499693e1e0fc90bdfeb1828f0aad6a5ab37f27d4a9e2680f0b92de371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1da8ca46cba0e7cdb5b8178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，成功了…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "89f81fce6d1a7fc948fb5c30e5e09beb1dbbd9ebc203e7828e0c090188f82ab3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81a3fcebe8613f9b624c4e60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊…今年\n也要结束了呢。和哥哥相遇以来\n每天都过得很快呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "0480fccb8cdddcaed78d4dae5b5e74223c8ce3c1f2ac21ea676e860b9c837908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42fe2e5a41c969b9efddf04e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭贺新年，哥哥！\n今天一天，希望能够发生\n很多幸福的事…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b0d92ac18d43977d791e8e3edf4dad8396cab6898bc96a42cf0a0daa62918a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b95185cb0466a11c9fb81977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直都在等着这个值得庆祝\n的日子。…哥哥，听我说哦。\n感谢你能来到我身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "660a1c73b03abe14e801b5ccb9ff8a5bba6565f2c497bfed2b951cad5023fef4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aab04508a98353d366092734",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大，大家都在说『恭喜』…\n但是米浴，却哭了…\n真是困扰呢…呜诶诶诶…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b063aed35c31788801b1ac67dc3e2b99d6468618138f68777c7fb3bf4cb0f0ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe9f38fa46a96800970d98d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的祝福，哥哥。\n为了成为能够回报很多\n的米浴…要加油了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bc580299b53119475886ebff6f45e104876a7050508b5384fee271ab127eb40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b8175d2d54a876b0b70d06c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥，哥哥！\n那个呢，好像有什么通知\n在那里哦…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54f3121d38af22008c9577a6b749fc534e120713595907437d086f0d4e4b179",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3b63daaa512af6d849506e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，刚才\n礼物送到了！\n米浴也，可以一起看吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdf3b330803f46c2789eff78461a3931ea17c2fccaa84306fa349699b4ccec0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf4e363b231735e30052476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标达成，恭西…！\n啊啊，咬到舌头了～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7da7405675aec27296f7e5d487bbb80d5a820b7e54964ec99a5361099569f1b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07d5dc0247a467df2b9ae8ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马上就要有活动了呢。\n…要做什么准备呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b21efff2427307266ecc6c5a75899939461d3a205ba1816c62dbc9751c3fe710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba16c986164d984546bd3635",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那边好像，在举办活动呢…\n为了不给别人添麻烦、\n悄悄地看一下吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "522e20b833b3f864a66fa938ba3f1882d8bbce7d92725c568cbe1cbba8116205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04edd80d95ef46026c6623b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜，输掉了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bb82559d0cdb1d60324c5edd5cf32862a57d6c9cba331512dfe1bf7485e7dfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e20867db310eefd8d3f1e12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级好像提高了…\n要去看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d7c82596709d5693e515b94ac60e15be99b1a33aa762753bf8ef1e66a09c1b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d649da42e1ec6ec99b938566",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套连身洋装，和我喜欢的绘本主角\r\n穿的款式相同……因为我希望自己\r\n能够和她一样鼓起勇气……",
      "source_fingerprint": "175558807914e4b256cfeaf12d74ade05f94d73e84e549c2a8a2b304ce700030",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b744bb486e320996b26740c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴和波旁去买了东西……♪\r\n米浴推荐喜爱的绘本后，她就\r\n买了下来……希望她会喜欢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a1afe29775075ab842f2feb3b0ace8efd7976e930a0a451e4cde1076136a93a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21de8420af8bc4e0539c681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要和丸姐去舞厅，\r\n所以在学习又时髦又潮？的穿搭……\r\n紧身裙看起来好成熟，真是不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8433a8b83d6d30af507d108be3177d96e7a525f6f26f0827ceba1d9dafacb723",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe84c0733576c4f6b76156b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局…好可惜啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "619a267faa3c75b977a307d83d148e447567ac6a5fffa843c61e67d2928038e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79fd1e26f21ffa9e73a932e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴我们的胜利呢…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e654576db8b14e146b41586b269f5a63ea070b8833a37f788094899b373efc2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad320b9fb241ae06aaea0a31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜，输掉了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bb82559d0cdb1d60324c5edd5cf32862a57d6c9cba331512dfe1bf7485e7dfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108cc2d96ad6f6fc9e74a194",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局…好可惜啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "619a267faa3c75b977a307d83d148e447567ac6a5fffa843c61e67d2928038e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5931bc99db1e3ca1b2484836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高分也…太厉害了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f507bedb5025167b5f49f12aec6d73cc0c4b60567c59f5ffe0cae2c10673605f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd6d147fc09a6639c120b30d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哇哇…！加，加油吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "588b78234eb476dc55268dc24bbaddd2379e57e3a26f2a944ad68575615e9dfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9efff9efa607364b7b5505f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐…这个，那个…\n米浴，每天都会努力的。\n…也会慢慢地改变，相信我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17cb5ed551f8a094aa9d89a830014ae2d004e4c653292011801158912c5a99fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29cf71369b3e2f20b0a8be0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\n…那个，姐姐…米浴今年也\n请多多指教…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4dabbee101b6538b1ec4b2038024333f88274b8ee4e76add963bb8f43b61f2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41201143e11148d11311d247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…情人节了呢，姐姐。\n那，那个。那个，那个…还有\n时间，一起吃巧克力吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "616c9442732e15a60b77c536169b13c984f3a4fd8bcd3b26f4e88420c5f1a1a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb1b79e5a22f2b1dc22e69ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐。因为是情人节…\n和米浴一起做巧克力吧！\n食谱已经写好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea19fbdd0e9e083ac510dad5661ea9cdd75239794db8f0d9af80d3fc8a253a14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c51e43a0637cef1cc51cc058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是烤的像圣诞老人\n衣服一样红的苹果蛋糕。\n姐姐…一起吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07cff532a8d9e792559aa44cfe2049728ba16a6573388d237491a5f8e48ba9ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e5eac0eba2f5da5ecce7c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊…今年\n也要结束了呢。和姐姐相遇以来\n每天都过得很快呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "814f2900d155f90fe4c5c05cdb87bd275132cb716e1ed86d65c8b41e060a6bed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d47350d631e1b93fb1562654",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭贺新年，姐姐！\n今天一天，希望能够发生\n很多幸福的事…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92e852a9da12543f593a8da4330bfb8c3e6a59cc86586b2449595878be52e2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dede4c02b1c3df124f805218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直都在等着这个值得庆祝\n的日子。…姐姐，听我说哦。\n感谢你能来到我身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cafac22b34a00736544669e12a42c468cd1ed3b90e730a28d33d06ce992d1f6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3ab3cdd53fd75fcaf5c5b14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的祝福，姐姐。\n为了成为能够回报很多\n的米浴…要加油了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99cdc51babb1d27c818cdb34626501e7e3cc7862d633cbcb1547450d5cf90676",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d5aa7eec1322b53d48c1e76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐，姐姐！\n那个呢，好像有什么通知\n在那里哦…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11df2a82b9a3b35f559b7f923f46df23834d21396a93cb7876d8f6c7dedc4d7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b5800885d062e2ebe91920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cab1e5dddd1386e67132f02243f49064123e85e363e7f16c74c071eb1681d50f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb22e62dc85393b53e074388",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "193e96b6728f6377a628ca03643fcf60fdfe92443c93c61f47b672cda1b24d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dce061e6058eb28eb58f085c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们要编织出……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee4b342a4f9d8f9bb6bd82c1b28841d1b5eab957273e125e2449502a24d96f7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:921ee84f1536465c9eede92a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哔、哔ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df0549ed75cfb490a38009df63c990c4a18a70d245c04c62f9b8beca278b1cd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0754144282b967cb4636a2d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf0b3438b0572f7262924577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去…训练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a70fcad5e7a620d9720a98f19d28ecab5d00a1d83e5cead8cae1e177a964bc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75dcd1da49a8a55d4fc93fa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "充满了快乐的回忆呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4821608bd54a2fc99e4a618fb970e3356862d329265cef34a1537f1c164e2e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b86de048883538a56361a1eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参加比赛吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0545c80078c29c4a726b941088a581ecfeb001c05f49244709bfbfdbac00ce52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47daf4329487f690fd113754",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，好…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e3944091db7d904aaa3c03db7b2ca80d4ae6d2b3e3885d68d24aadcaff3993d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
